<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan yarn rates close unchanged on low demand.</title>
<headline>Pakistan yarn rates close unchanged on low demand.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed unchanged on Thursday on low demand from users, dealers said. Rates are likely to remain stable in the current week, one dealer said.</p>
<p>Following are the rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21 counts:</p>
<p>				     Thursday    March 24</p>
<p>    Al-Karam		     480	   480</p>
<p>    Taj Textile		  480	   480</p>
<p>    Globe			  475	   475</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
